docs/system-design/backlog/
docs/system-design/internal/
docs/product/

# Personal notes addressed to the project owner. Everything this repository ships is
# English; a report, review or plan written for one reader in another language belongs
# here and never in the tree. Keeping the folder ignored is what makes the rule
# enforceable by accident rather than by memory - a draft written here cannot be swept
# into a commit by a blanket `git add`.
/local-notes/

